* text=auto

*.py text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf

*.x binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.dat binary
*.con binary
*.grd binary
*.bin binary

# 栅格数据（站点裁剪件等）：按二进制处理，避免行尾/编码转换
*.tif binary
*.img binary

# 参考案例工作区（project/cases/<case>/**）保存的是原始链路捕获产物，
# 其 SHA-256 冻结在 docs/reconstruction_cpp/*_CAPTURE.md 中。必须逐字节保存：
# 若做行尾转换，冻结哈希无法由仓库检出复现（NOAA ISD/IGRA 派生的 CSV 为 CRLF）。
project/cases/** -text

# Disabled workflow archive is provenance, not newly formatted YAML.
docs/migration/historical-workflows/** -text

# Full GLCC landuse raster is stored in Git LFS.
/eausgs2_0la.img filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

